        "contenuto_esteso": "King Charles III on Tuesday becomes the first British monarch to address the US Congress since his mother, Queen Elizabeth II, in 1991. His speech is ‌a central event of the state visit – the most high-profile of Charles's reign so far – and will be followed by a state dinner later that evening. Watch his speech live by clicking on the live player above."
